{"title":"GST Consultant Roadmap","role":"GST Consultant","summary":"A GST Consultant helps businesses and organizations understand and comply with India's Goods and Services Tax framework. The work can include GST registration, classification, invoicing, return compliance, reconciliations, notices, assessments, refunds, audits, and litigation support.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Taxation Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A GST Consultant helps businesses and organizations understand and comply with India's Goods and Services Tax framework. The work can include GST registration, classification, invoicing, return compliance, reconciliations, notices, assessments, refunds, audits, and litigation support."},{"type":"p","text":"For an LLB graduate, the strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Tax Law","GST Compliance","Legal Research","Documentation","Tax Technology"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Typical work includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GST registration and amendments"},{"text":"GST classification research"},{"text":"Taxability analysis"},{"text":"Input Tax Credit review"},{"text":"Return-compliance support"},{"text":"GST reconciliations"},{"text":"E-invoicing/e-way bill awareness"},{"text":"GST notices and responses"},{"text":"Refund matters"},{"text":"GST audits/assessments support"},{"text":"Appeals and litigation support"},{"text":"GST advisory under appropriate professional scope"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Professional note","text":"“GST Consultant” is not itself a single statutory professional designation. The exact services a person can independently offer depend on applicable tax law, professional regulations, authorization requirements, and the individual's qualification. An LLB provides a strong legal foundation, but some tax-compliance or certification activities may require additional professional qualifications or authorization."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career Stage","Possible Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Tax Intern, GST Intern, Tax Research Associate"}],[{"text":"1–3 Years"},{"text":"GST Executive, Tax Associate, GST Consultant – Junior"}],[{"text":"3–6 Years"},{"text":"GST Consultant, Tax Advisory Associate, GST Compliance Specialist"}],[{"text":"6–10 Years"},{"text":"Senior GST Consultant, Indirect Tax Manager"}],[{"text":"10+ Years"},{"text":"Head – Indirect Tax, Tax Partner, GST Advisory Lead"}],[{"text":"Long Term"},{"text":"Independent Tax Consultant, Tax Litigation Specialist, Indirect Tax Strategist"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the LLB","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Tax & Commercial Law Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Constitutional foundations of taxation"},{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Commercial law"},{"text":"Corporate law"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Legal interpretation"},{"text":"Accounting fundamentals"},{"text":"Business structures"},{"text":"Tax terminology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the business lifecycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business","Transaction","Invoice","Tax Treatment","Accounting Entry","GST Reporting","Reconciliation","Compliance"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — GST Specialization"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop deeper knowledge of the GST framework."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CGST"},{"text":"SGST"},{"text":"IGST"},{"text":"UTGST"},{"text":"GST Council framework"},{"text":"Supply"},{"text":"Goods vs services"},{"text":"Taxable supply"},{"text":"Exempt supply"},{"text":"Zero-rated supply"},{"text":"Place of supply"},{"text":"Time of supply"},{"text":"Value of supply"},{"text":"Input Tax Credit"},{"text":"Reverse charge"},{"text":"Registration"},{"text":"Returns"},{"text":"Payment"},{"text":"Refunds"},{"text":"The objective is to understand how a business transaction moves through the GST system."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Practical GST Advisory & Litigation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build practical capability in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GST registration"},{"text":"Return workflows"},{"text":"ITC reconciliation"},{"text":"Tax classification"},{"text":"GST notices"},{"text":"Reply drafting"},{"text":"Assessment procedures"},{"text":"Refund applications"},{"text":"Appeals"},{"text":"Advance-ruling concepts"},{"text":"GST litigation research"},{"text":"Tax documentation"},{"text":"Client communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"GST Compliance Lifecycle"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Transaction","GST Applicability","Tax Classification","Invoice","ITC / Tax Calculation","Accounting","GST Return","Reconciliation","Payment","Compliance Review"]},{"type":"h","text":"Core Professional Skills"},{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Priority"],"rows":[[{"text":"GST Law"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Tax Research"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Legal Interpretation"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"GST Compliance"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Input Tax Credit"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Tax Classification"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Legal Drafting"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Accounting Fundamentals"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Client Communication"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Tax Technology"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Litigation Support"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"GST Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong GST consultant should understand the relationship between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supply","Taxability","Place of Supply","Time of Supply","Value","Applicable Tax","ITC","Return","Payment"]},{"type":"p","text":"Each transaction needs to be analyzed according to the applicable provisions and current rules."},{"type":"h","text":"GST Classification"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to determine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Goods vs services"},{"text":"HSN classification"},{"text":"SAC classification"},{"text":"Tax rate"},{"text":"Exemption"},{"text":"Notification applicability"},{"text":"Special treatment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Classification Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product / Service","Understand Characteristics","Identify HSN / SAC","Check Applicable Schedule / Notification","Determine Tax Rate","Check Exemption / Special Rule","Document Conclusion"]},{"type":"p","text":"A consultant should maintain supporting evidence for classification decisions."},{"type":"h","text":"Input Tax Credit"},{"type":"p","text":"ITC is one of the most important GST areas."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Eligibility"},{"text":"Conditions"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Reconciliation"},{"text":"Blocked credits"},{"text":"Reversal"},{"text":"Reclaim"},{"text":"Business-use considerations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"ITC Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Purchase Invoice","Supplier Data","GST System Data","Reconciliation","Eligibility Check","ITC Claim","Accounting","Reversal / Adjustment if Required"]},{"type":"h","text":"GST Reconciliation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong Excel skills for reconciling:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Purchase register"},{"text":"Sales register"},{"text":"GST return data"},{"text":"Tax invoices"},{"text":"ITC records"},{"text":"Accounting records"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Reconciliation Process"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Books"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Purchase Register"},{"text":"+"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["GST Data","Data Cleaning","Invoice Matching","Mismatch Identification","Vendor Follow-up","ITC / Tax Adjustment","Final Reconciliation"]},{"type":"h","text":"GST Returns & Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the purpose and workflow of relevant GST returns and statements."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sales reporting"},{"text":"Purchase/ITC data"},{"text":"Tax liability"},{"text":"Tax payment"},{"text":"Reconciliation"},{"text":"Annual compliance concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact forms, filing requirements, due dates, and rules can change, so professionals must verify the current GST portal requirements and applicable notifications."},{"type":"h","text":"GST Registration"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Who may need registration"},{"text":"Threshold concepts"},{"text":"Compulsory-registration situations"},{"text":"Voluntary registration"},{"text":"Registration amendments"},{"text":"Cancellation"},{"text":"Revocation concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Registration Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Assessment","Registration Applicability","Document Collection","Application","Verification","GSTIN","Post-Registration Compliance"]},{"type":"h","text":"E-Invoicing & E-Way Bills"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"E-invoice concepts"},{"text":"Invoice Reference Number"},{"text":"QR code concepts"},{"text":"E-way bills"},{"text":"Movement of goods"},{"text":"Invoice data flow"},{"text":"Compliance exceptions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how digital tax systems connect:"},{"type":"flow","items":["ERP / Accounting System","GST Technology Layer","E-Invoice / E-Way Bill","GST Records","Return / Reconciliation"]},{"type":"h","text":"GST Notices & Litigation"},{"type":"p","text":"An LLB graduate can build a strong niche in GST legal advisory and dispute support."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Notice analysis"},{"text":"SCN concepts"},{"text":"Reply drafting"},{"text":"Evidence compilation"},{"text":"Assessment proceedings"},{"text":"Appeal procedures"},{"text":"Legal grounds"},{"text":"Case-law research"},{"text":"Judicial interpretation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Notice-Response Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["GST Notice","Identify Allegations","Review Facts","Collect Documents","Research Applicable Law","Research Case Law","Prepare Response","Professional Review","Submission","Follow-up"]},{"type":"h","text":"GST Litigation Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reading GST judgments"},{"text":"Interpreting statutory provisions"},{"text":"Studying notifications/circulars"},{"text":"Identifying conflicting decisions"},{"text":"Tracking appellate decisions"},{"text":"Preparing case-law notes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research Framework"},{"type":"flow","items":["Tax Issue","GST Provision","Rules","Notification / Circular","Judicial Decisions","Interpretation","Client-Specific Facts","Legal Position"]},{"type":"h","text":"Accounting Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"A GST consultant does not need to become a full-time accountant, but accounting literacy is essential."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Journal entries"},{"text":"Ledger"},{"text":"Trial balance"},{"text":"P&L"},{"text":"Balance sheet"},{"text":"Receivables"},{"text":"Payables"},{"text":"Purchase/sales cycles"},{"text":"Tax ledgers"},{"text":"Reconciliation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Transaction Understanding"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Transaction","Accounting Entry","Invoice","GST Treatment","Tax Ledger","Return"]},{"type":"h","text":"Excel & Data Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced Excel can become a major advantage."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"IF/IFS"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Duplicate detection"},{"text":"Reconciliation dashboards"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"flow","items":["100,000 Invoices","Excel / Power Query","Clean Data","Match GST Records","Identify Exceptions","Review High-Risk Transactions"]},{"type":"h","text":"AI & GST"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GST notification summarization"},{"text":"Case-law research support"},{"text":"Invoice classification"},{"text":"Document extraction"},{"text":"Reconciliation"},{"text":"Notice summarization"},{"text":"Compliance-calendar management"},{"text":"Drafting first-pass responses"},{"text":"Regulatory monitoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Responsible AI Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["GST Update","AI Summary","Read Primary Source","Check Applicability","Interpret Legal Position","Client-Specific Analysis","Final Advice"]},{"type":"p","text":"Never treat an AI-generated tax interpretation as authoritative. GST advice should be verified against current legislation, rules, notifications, circulars, official guidance, and relevant case law."},{"type":"h","text":"GST Technology Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools and concepts include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GST portal"},{"text":"Accounting software"},{"text":"ERP systems"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Document-management systems"},{"text":"Tax-compliance platforms"},{"text":"OCR/document extraction"},{"text":"RegTech"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A future-ready GST consultant should understand the relationship between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["ERP","Accounting","GST Systems","Reconciliation","Compliance"]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project Ideas"}]},{"heading":"GST Reconciliation Dashboard","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Create an Excel/Power BI dashboard for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Purchase invoices"},{"text":"GST data"},{"text":"ITC"},{"text":"Mismatches"},{"text":"Vendor issues"}]}]},{"heading":"GST Compliance Calendar","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build a system tracking:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Filing requirements"},{"text":"Due dates"},{"text":"Responsible teams"},{"text":"Status"},{"text":"Risk"}]}]},{"heading":"GST Classification Study","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Analyze GST classification issues for a selected industry."}]},{"heading":"E-Invoicing Compliance Study","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Study how digital invoicing affects business compliance."}]},{"heading":"GST Litigation Research","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Analyze a selected GST legal issue through statutory provisions and judicial decisions."}]},{"heading":"AI-Assisted GST Compliance Framework","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Design a system for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory monitoring"},{"text":"Invoice classification"},{"text":"Reconciliation"},{"text":"Notice tracking"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tax consulting firms"},{"text":"CA firms"},{"text":"Law firms with tax practices"},{"text":"Indirect-tax teams"},{"text":"Big Four firms"},{"text":"Corporate tax departments"},{"text":"GST advisory firms"},{"text":"Accounting/ERP companies"},{"text":"Tax technology companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Internship Roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GST Intern"},{"text":"Tax Intern"},{"text":"Indirect Tax Intern"},{"text":"Tax Research Intern"},{"text":"GST Compliance Intern"},{"text":"Legal & Tax Intern"},{"text":"Tax Litigation Intern"},{"text":"Indirect Tax Research Associate"}]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Role","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Tax Intern"},{"text":"Tax research and compliance"}],[{"text":"GST Intern"},{"text":"GST documentation"}],[{"text":"Tax Research Associate"},{"text":"GST/legal research"}],[{"text":"GST Executive"},{"text":"Compliance"}],[{"text":"GST Compliance Associate"},{"text":"Returns and reconciliation"}],[{"text":"Indirect Tax Associate"},{"text":"Advisory"}],[{"text":"GST Litigation Associate"},{"text":"Notices and disputes"}],[{"text":"Tax Analyst"},{"text":"Tax data and analysis"}],[{"text":"Tax Technology Associate"},{"text":"GST systems"}],[{"text":"Junior GST Consultant"},{"text":"Client advisory support"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Priority"],"rows":[[{"text":"GST Law"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Tax Research"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"GST Compliance"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Legal Interpretation"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"ITC"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Reconciliation"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Legal Drafting"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Accounting Basics"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Tax Technology"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Litigation"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Case-Law Research"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"AI/RegTech"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GST fundamentals"},{"text":"Indirect taxation"},{"text":"Tax litigation"},{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tax technology"},{"text":"Corporate taxation"},{"text":"Transfer pricing fundamentals"},{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Professional tax qualifications can further strengthen the profile depending on the student's intended practice."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Higher Education Options"},{"type":"p","text":"After LLB, consider:"},{"type":"h","text":"LL.M"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Taxation Law"},{"text":"Corporate & Commercial Law"},{"text":"Business Law"},{"text":"Financial Law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional / Specialized Pathways"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Chartered Accountancy"},{"text":"Company Secretary"},{"text":"Cost & Management Accountancy"},{"text":"Specialized taxation programs"},{"text":"Indirect-tax certifications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a law graduate who wants to become a highly specialized tax professional, combining law + formal tax/accounting expertise can be particularly valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"},{"type":"p","text":"A GST Consultant can specialize in:"},{"type":"h","text":"GST Compliance"},{"type":"h","text":"GST Advisory"},{"type":"h","text":"GST Litigation"},{"type":"h","text":"GST Reconciliation"},{"type":"h","text":"GST Audit Support"},{"type":"h","text":"GST Refunds"},{"type":"h","text":"GST Classification"},{"type":"h","text":"E-Invoicing"},{"type":"h","text":"Indirect Tax Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Tax Due Diligence"},{"type":"h","text":"M&A Tax Support"},{"type":"h","text":"Sector-Specific GST"},{"type":"h","text":"Tax Research"},{"type":"h","text":"International Indirect Tax"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["LLB Graduate","Tax / GST Intern","GST Executive / Tax Associate","GST Consultant","Senior GST Consultant","Indirect Tax Manager","Indirect Tax Lead / Tax Partner","GST / Tax Advisory Specialist"]},{"type":"h","text":"Law + Tax Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["LLB","Tax Law Associate","GST / Indirect Tax Associate","Tax Litigation Specialist","Senior Tax Counsel","Tax Advisory / Litigation Leadership"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies to Learn"},{"type":"p","text":"Future GST professionals should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-powered tax research"},{"text":"Automated GST reconciliation"},{"text":"RegTech"},{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"Invoice intelligence"},{"text":"ERP-GST integration"},{"text":"E-invoicing automation"},{"text":"Tax analytics"},{"text":"Compliance dashboards"},{"text":"Automated regulatory monitoring"},{"text":"Document intelligence"},{"text":"Generative AI"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The emerging profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["GST Law","Tax Compliance","Data","Automation","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Tax & Legal"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GST Law"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Tax Interpretation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Legal Research"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Case Law"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Legal Drafting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GST Registration"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Returns"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"ITC"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Reconciliation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"E-Invoicing"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Notices"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Data Cleaning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Reconciliation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GST Portal"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"ERP"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Tax Software"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"RegTech"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong GST-law fundamentals"},{"text":"Knowledge of indirect taxation"},{"text":"GST registration and compliance exposure"},{"text":"ITC understanding"},{"text":"GST reconciliation skills"},{"text":"Accounting fundamentals"},{"text":"Legal research capability"},{"text":"Tax-notice research/drafting exposure"},{"text":"Strong Excel skills"},{"text":"Basic Power Query/Power BI"},{"text":"GST technology awareness"},{"text":"Case-law research ability"},{"text":"Tax litigation exposure"},{"text":"Professional client communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Portfolio"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"5+ GST Legal Research Notes"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"3+ GST Case Analyses"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 GST Compliance Calendar"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 GST Reconciliation Dashboard"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 ITC Analysis Project"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 GST Classification Study"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 GST Notice Response Exercise"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"1 GST / Tax Internship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For GST Consultant, the strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["LLB","GST Law","Indirect Tax","Compliance","ITC","Reconciliation","Legal Research","Tax Technology"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The most effective pathway is to combine legal expertise with accounting and technology skills. This allows the graduate to progress from basic GST compliance into GST advisory, tax litigation, indirect-tax consulting, tax technology, due diligence, and senior tax leadership."}]}]}